          "type": "choice",
          "choices": [
            "EXPEDITED SERVICE: Ineligible. CF HH did not provide enough information to determine eligibility to Expedited Service.",
            "EXPEDITED SERVICE: Ineligible. CF HH reported more than $150 in Gross Monthly Income or more than $100 in Liquid Resources that exceed reported monthly housing expenses.",
            "EXPEDITED SERVICE: Potentially eligible. CF HH reported less than $150 in Gross Monthly Income and less than $100 in Liquid Resources.",
            "EXPEDITED SERVICE: Potentially eligible. CF HH reported monthly housing expenses that exceed combined Gross Monthly Income and available Liquid Resources.",
            "EXPEDITED SERVICE: Potentially eligible. CF HH reported to be a \"destitute\" Migrant Seasonal Farmworker and has less than $100 in available Liquid Resources."
